  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop the carrot. Finely chop the garlic. Trim the green beans and cut into small pieces. Roughly chop the baby bok choy. Thinly slice the makrut lime leaves.\n• TIP: Makrut lime leaves have a fibrous texture, so make sure you cut them thinly!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5db703085f3ea67c2b87/step-0c41a71e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! The curry paste is spicy, use less if you're sensitive to heat. In a large pot or saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Cook the carrot, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add the Thai green curry paste (see ingredients) and garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the coconut cream, water, lime leaves and crumble in the vegetable stock (1 cube for 2 people / 2 cubes for 4 people). Stir to combine well, then bring to a simmer.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5db703085f3ea67c2b87/step-3ed0a45e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the green beans and flat noodles to the pan and cook until the beans and noodles are tender, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5db703085f3ea67c2b87/step-a955a121.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir the baby bok choy through the soup until wilted, 2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5db703085f3ea67c2b87/step-35c162b5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the soy sauce to the soup and stir to combine.\n• Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5db703085f3ea67c2b87/step-81c1e91b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thinly slice the long red chilli (if using). Divide the Thai green coconut noodle soup between bowls and top with the chilli and crushed peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5db703085f3ea67c2b87/step-33a13d0c.jpg"
    }
  ]
